# E §5 example (synthetic), the clawback: "If the law claws it back in four instalments, the model writes a move keyed
# by the adjustment and the instalment, whose legs run from the account to the payer, each fulfilling its adjustment;
# an adjustment's settlements summed against its δ give the remainder still owed."  Twelve adjustments of -500.00 PLN
# (E5_benefit_example); claw[a, i] pays -a.change / 4 = 125.00 PLN on add_months(a.day, i), from konto to payer: the
# other way from the adjusted leg, so each counts -125.00 and the remainder is -500 - 4 x (-125) = 0 (step 5): no
# HOLE-CHANGED, no adjustment: line.  flows(konto, 2028-04) = 12 x -125.00 = -1 500.00 PLN; March holds none; konto ends
# the year at 6 000 - 6 000 = 0.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model b
  tally 2
  on 2028-06-30
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2028-12-31

source act "benefit act"
source cut_act "the act that cuts it"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind benefits: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
kind waivers: event certain
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place payer: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input benefit: money PLN
input pay_dom: int
input n_inst: int
index instalments = int 1..4

move pay[m in months]: benefits
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from payer to konto amount benefit

version act_2027
  cite act
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  benefit = 500.00 PLN governs 2027 "art. 1"
  benefit = 0 PLN governs 2028.. "art. 3: paid through 2027"
  pay_dom = 15 "art. 2"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2027-01-01 start "wyciąg"

move claw[a in adjustments over .. where a.adjusts in benefits, i in instalments]: transfers
  on add_months(a.day, i)
  fulfils a
  leg cash from konto to payer amount -a.change / n_inst

version rules
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  n_inst = 4

version cut_2027
  cite cut_act
  governs 2027
  known 2028-03-01
  replace benefit = 0 PLN "art. 1"

ask r: sum(a.change for a in adjustments over .. where a.adjusts in benefits)
ask f: flows(konto, 2028-04), flows(konto, 2028-03)
ask g: bal(konto, 2028-12-31)
=== expect
f: (-1 500.00 PLN, 0.00 PLN)
...
g: 0.00 PLN
...
r: -6 000.00 PLN
  cut 2028-06-30
